  "title": {
   "en": "Karappo Seijo to shite Suterareta Hazu ga, Totsugi-saki no Koutei Heika ni Dekiaisareteimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "空っぽ聖女として捨てられたはずが、嫁ぎ先の皇帝陛下に溺愛されています"
   },
   {
    "en": "She Should Have Been Abandoned as an Empty Saint, but She Is Doted on by Her Husband, the Emperor"
   },
   {
    "en": "Abandoned as a Worthless Saint, But I’m Now the Emperor’s Cherished Wife"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Tiana, known across the kingdom as the \"Empty Saint,\" has seen her magic drain away year after year. Cast out to the cursed empire as little more than a sacrificial pawn, she nearly dies—until her memories return.\n\nIn a past life, she was not powerless. She was Elce, the revered High Saint of the Empire.\n\nWelcomed as a bride by the very nation that once seemed her doom, she finds herself face to face with Emperor Felix—her former disciple, now grown into a commanding and aloof ruler.\n\n\"This marriage is only until the empire stabilizes,\" Felix insists.\n\nBut as memories flicker and emotions stir, the line between past and present begins to blur.\nAnd for Felix… she may no longer be just a bride of convenience—but the one he never forgot."
  },
